---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = "Aviso Legal | Buon Appetito • Port d'Andratx";
const description = "Información legal, titularidad y condiciones de uso de Buon Appetito en Port d'Andratx, Mallorca.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Top Minimalist Header for Legal Pages -->
  <header class="bg-[#183321] text-[#FBF9F5] py-4 px-5 sm:px-10 border-b border-white/10 sticky top-0 z-40 backdrop-blur-md bg-opacity-95">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 group" aria-label="Volver a Buon Appetito">
        <img 
          src="/assets/logos/logo-buon-appetito-color-dark.png" 
          alt="Buon Appetito Port d'Andratx" 
          class="h-8 sm:h-9 w-auto object-contain transition-transform group-hover:scale-105"
        />
      </a>
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6">
        <!-- Selector de idioma -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-black/25 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-xs text-white/90" role="group" aria-label="Selector de idioma">
          <button type="button" data-lang-btn="es" onclick="window.setBuonLanguage('es')" class="text-white font-bold cursor-pointer" title="Español">ES</button>
          <span class="text-white/40">·</span>
          <button type="button" data-lang-btn="en" onclick="window.setBuonLanguage('en')" class="hover:text-white cursor-pointer opacity-60" title="English">EN</button>
          <span class="text-white/40">·</span>
          <button type="button" data-lang-btn="de" onclick="window.setBuonLanguage('de')" class="hover:text-white cursor-pointer opacity-60" title="Deutsch">DE</button>
        </div>

        <button 
          type="button" 
          onclick="if (window.history.length > 1 && document.referrer && document.referrer.includes(window.location.host)) { window.history.back(); } else { window.location.href = '/#footer'; }"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-white/90 hover:text-white transition-all bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 active:scale-95 px-3.5 sm:px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full cursor-pointer border border-white/10"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
          </svg>
          <span data-i18n="legal_back">Volver atrás</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Document Body Wrapper (Warm Ivory Premium Background) -->
  <div class="bg-[#FBF9F5] text-[#1B1C1A] w-full">
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-12 sm:py-20 text-[#1B1C1A] font-satoshi">
    
      <!-- Title & Date Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-[#D9D4CC]/60 pb-8 mb-10">
        <span data-i18n="legal_aviso_badge" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#9E4221] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-2 font-satoshi">
          Información Legal
        </span>
        <h1 data-i18n="legal_aviso_title" class="font-boska text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl text-[#183321] font-normal tracking-tight">
          Aviso Legal
        </h1>
        
        <!-- Date Subtitles per Language -->
        <p data-lang-block="es" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#424842] mt-3">
          Última actualización: <strong>Octubre 2026</strong> · Información conforme al artículo 10 de la Ley 34/2002 (LSSI-CE).
        </p>
        <p data-lang-block="en" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#424842] mt-3 hidden">
          Last updated: <strong>October 2026</strong> · Legal disclosure pursuant to Article 10 of Spanish Law 34/2002 (LSSI-CE).
        </p>
        <p data-lang-block="de" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#424842] mt-3 hidden">
          Zuletzt aktualisiert: <strong>Oktober 2026</strong> · Impressum und Angaben gemäß Artikel 10 des spanischen Gesetzes LSSI-CE.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- ========================================== -->
      <!-- CONTENIDO EN ESPAÑOL                       -->
      <!-- ========================================== -->
      <div data-lang-block="es" class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2C302D]">
        <!-- 1. Titularidad -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            1. Datos identificativos
          </h2>
          <p>
            En cumplimiento del artículo 10 de la Ley 34/2002 (LSSI-CE), se informa de los datos del titular del sitio web:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-white border border-[#D9D4CC]/70 rounded-2xl p-5 text-sm sm:text-base space-y-1.5 shadow-xs">
            <p><strong>Razón social:</strong> Buon Apeetito av.24 SL.</p>
            <p><strong>Nombre comercial:</strong> Buon Appetito Port d'Andratx</p>
            <p><strong>NIF / CIF:</strong> B26841494</p>
            <p><strong>Domicilio:</strong> Av. Mateo Bosch, 24, 07157 Port d'Andratx, Illes Balears, España</p>
            <p><strong>Contacto:</strong> <a href="tel:+34632446064" class="text-[#9E4221] hover:underline font-medium">+34 632 44 60 64</a> · <a href="mailto:buonappetitoandratx@gmail.com" class="text-[#9E4221] hover:underline font-medium">buonappetitoandratx@gmail.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Objeto y uso de la web -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            2. Finalidad del sitio web
          </h2>
          <p>
            Este sitio web tiene como finalidad dar a conocer la propuesta gastronómica, carta, vinos, horarios e historia de Buon Appetito, así como facilitar la reserva de mesas y el contacto directo con nuestro equipo.
          </p>
          <p>
            La navegación atribuye la condición de usuario e implica la aceptación responsable de las condiciones aquí expuestas.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Propiedad Intelectual -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            3. Propiedad intelectual
          </h2>
          <p>
            Todos los contenidos de esta web (fotografías, logotipos, textos, cartas y diseño) son propiedad exclusiva de Buon Appetito o disponen de las licencias oportunas. Queda prohibida su reproducción o uso comercial sin autorización previa y por escrito.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Carta y Precios -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            4. Precios y disponibilidad
          </h2>
          <p>
            Los platos y vinos reflejan nuestra oferta habitual. Debido a la estacionalidad del pescado fresco de lonja y a las materias primas del mercado, la disponibilidad y los precios pueden variar puntualmente. Las reservas quedan confirmadas directamente por nuestro equipo.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. Legislación y Jurisdicción -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            5. Legislación aplicable
          </h2>
          <p>
            Este sitio se rige por la legislación española. Para cualquier controversia, las partes se someten a los juzgados y tribunales de Palma de Mallorca (Illes Balears).
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- ========================================== -->
      <!-- CONTENIDO EN INGLÉS                        -->
      <!-- ========================================== -->
      <div data-lang-block="en" class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2C302D] hidden">
        <!-- 1. Identification -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            1. Legal Identification
          </h2>
          <p>
            In compliance with Article 10 of Spanish Law 34/2002 (LSSI-CE), the company details of this website are set out below:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-white border border-[#D9D4CC]/70 rounded-2xl p-5 text-sm sm:text-base space-y-1.5 shadow-xs">
            <p><strong>Company name:</strong> Buon Apeetito av.24 SL.</p>
            <p><strong>Trade name:</strong> Buon Appetito Port d'Andratx</p>
            <p><strong>Tax ID (CIF):</strong> B26841494</p>
            <p><strong>Address:</strong> Av. Mateo Bosch, 24, 07157 Port d'Andratx, Balearic Islands, Spain</p>
            <p><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="tel:+34632446064" class="text-[#9E4221] hover:underline font-medium">+34 632 44 60 64</a> · <a href="mailto:buonappetitoandratx@gmail.com" class="text-[#9E4221] hover:underline font-medium">buonappetitoandratx@gmail.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Website Purpose -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            2. Purpose of the Website
          </h2>
          <p>
            The purpose of this website is to present the cuisine, menus, wine selection, opening hours and philosophy of Buon Appetito, as well as to facilitate table reservations and direct contact with our team.
          </p>
          <p>
            Browsing this site grants the status of user and implies full acceptance of these terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Intellectual Property -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            3. Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p>
            All elements of this website (photographs, logos, texts, menus and graphic layout) are the exclusive property of Buon Appetito or used under license. Reproduction or commercial use without prior written consent is strictly prohibited.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Menus & Availability -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            4. Menus and Availability
          </h2>
          <p>
            Dishes and wines presented online represent our current selection. Due to market seasonality and fresh port arrivals, availability and prices may vary slightly. Table reservations are confirmed directly by our team.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. Applicable Law -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            5. Applicable Law
          </h2>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by Spanish law. Any dispute shall be submitted to the competent courts of Palma de Mallorca (Balearic Islands, Spain).
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- ========================================== -->
      <!-- CONTENIDO EN ALEMÁN                        -->
      <!-- ========================================== -->
      <div data-lang-block="de" class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2C302D] hidden">
        <!-- 1. Impressum -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            1. Impressum und Angaben zum Betreiber
          </h2>
          <p>
            Gemäß Artikel 10 des spanischen Gesetzes über Informationsgesellschaft und E-Commerce (LSSI-CE):
          </p>
          <div class="bg-white border border-[#D9D4CC]/70 rounded-2xl p-5 text-sm sm:text-base space-y-1.5 shadow-xs">
            <p><strong>Unternehmensname:</strong> Buon Apeetito av.24 SL.</p>
            <p><strong>Handelsname:</strong> Buon Appetito Port d'Andratx</p>
            <p><strong>Steuernummer (CIF):</strong> B26841494</p>
            <p><strong>Anschrift:</strong> Av. Mateo Bosch, 24, 07157 Port d'Andratx, Balearen, Spanien</p>
            <p><strong>Kontakt:</strong> <a href="tel:+34632446064" class="text-[#9E4221] hover:underline font-medium">+34 632 44 60 64</a> · <a href="mailto:buonappetitoandratx@gmail.com" class="text-[#9E4221] hover:underline font-medium">buonappetitoandratx@gmail.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Zweck der Website -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            2. Zweck des Online-Auftritts
          </h2>
          <p>
            Diese Website dient der Information über das kulinarische Angebot, Speisekarten, Weine, Öffnungszeiten und Tischreservierungen im Restaurant Buon Appetito in Port d'Andratx.
          </p>
          <p>
            Die Nutzung der Website setzt das Einverständnis mit den hier aufgeführten Bedingungen voraus.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Urheberrecht -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            3. Urheberrecht
          </h2>
          <p>
            Alle Inhalte dieser Website (Fotos, Texte, Logo, Speisekarten und grafisches Design) sind urheberrechtlich geschützt und Eigentum von Buon Appetito oder lizenzierten Partnern. Jede unbefugte Vervielfältigung ist untersagt.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Speisekarten und Verfügbarkeit -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            4. Speisekarte und Verfügbarkeit
          </h2>
          <p>
            Die dargestellten Gerichte und Weine zeigen unser reguläres Angebot. Durch die Frische saisonaler Hafen- und Marktzutaten können Verfügbarkeit und Preise tagesaktuell variieren. Reservierungen werden direkt vom Team bestätigt.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. Anwendbares Recht -->
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-boska text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#183321] font-normal">
            5. Anwendbares Recht
          </h2>
          <p>
            Es gilt spanisches Recht. Gerichtsstand für etwaige Streitigkeiten ist Palma de Mallorca (Balearen, Spanien).
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

    </main>
  </div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
